{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-meet-science2-11","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"chemistry","number":11,"points":null,"unitId":"electro","unitLabel":"산화·환원·전기화학","topic":"전지·산화수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["electro"],"stem":"연료전지는연속적으로공급되는연료로부터전기에너지를\n생산한다. 다음은수소연료전지와메테인(CH4) 연료전지의\n반응식이다.\nH2(g) ＋1\n수소전지:\n2 O2(g) →H2O(l) ＋286 kJ\n메테인전지: CH4(g) ＋2 O2(g) →CO2(g) ＋2 H2O(l) ＋561 kJ\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 메테인전지반응에서는탄소의산화수변화가없다.\nㄴ. 수소전지반응과메테인전지반응에서수소의산화수\n변화는같다.\nㄷ. 수소전지가메테인전지보다연료1 g당더많은에너지를\n생산한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":37,"height":5,"region":0,"bbox":[129.256,76.068,14.8,2.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-meet-science2-11/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":257,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,148.868,308.8,102.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-meet-science2-11/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":5,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,452.895],"width":333.756,"height":300.163,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[129.256,76.068,14.8,2.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.456,148.868,308.8,102.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"11. 연료전지는연속적으로공급되는연료로부터전기에너지를","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.539,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"11.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.401,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14